---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Nishikino｜ACHIEVEMENTS｜Media Features & Activities"
  description=""
>

<section class="bg-[#faf8f3] min-h-screen">


<section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

  <picture>
    <source
      media="(max-width: 639px)"
      srcset="/images/achievements-bg-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <img
      src="/images/achievements-bg.jpg"
      alt="Achievements"
      class="achievement-hero-bg absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
      draggable="false"
    />
  </picture>

</section>



  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">

    <!-- Large Washi Background -->

    <img
      src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />



    <section
      class="
        relative
        overflow-hidden
        py-14
        sm:py-16
        lg:py-20
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          relative
          mx-auto
          max-w-7xl
          px-5
          sm:px-8
          lg:px-10
        "
      >

        <p
          class="
            text-[10px]
            tracking-[0.4em]
            text-rose-500/80
          "
        >
          ACHIEVEMENTS
        </p>


        <h1
          class="
            mt-3
            text-4xl
            leading-tight
            text-white
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          The Path I Have Walked
        </h1>


        <p
          class="
            mt-6
            max-w-3xl
            text-sm
            leading-7
            text-white/90
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          My creations have been featured on news websites,
          social media, and YouTube channels in Japan and around the world,
          giving more and more people the opportunity to discover my work.

          <br /><br />

          This page presents my media features and activities
          in chronological order.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>



    <section
      class="
        relative
        min-h-screen
        overflow-hidden
        py-10
        sm:py-12
        lg:py-16
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          relative
          mx-auto
          max-w-7xl
          px-5
          sm:px-8
          lg:px-10
        "
      >

        <div
          class="
            grid
            items-start
            gap-5
            md:grid-cols-2
            xl:grid-cols-3
            sm:gap-6
          "
        >



          <article
            class="
              overflow-hidden
              rounded-[1.25rem]
              border
              border-white/60
              bg-white/90
              backdrop-blur-sm
              transition
              duration-500
              hover:-translate-y-1
              hover:shadow-xl
              sm:rounded-[1.5rem]
            "
          >

            <div class="achievement-media">

              <blockquote class="twitter-tweet">
                <a href="https://x.com/nishikinolab/status/1904832266984976533"></a>
              </blockquote>

            </div>


            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">

              <p
                class="
                  text-[10px]
                  tracking-[0.3em]
                  text-neutral-500
                "
                style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
              >
                2025 / 04 / 11
              </p>


              <h2
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xl
                  leading-tight
                  text-neutral-900
                "
                style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
              >
                Koedo Kawagoe Ichibangai<br />
                Kurazukuri Townscape
              </h2>


              <p
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xs
                  text-neutral-500
                "
              >
                My first creation to be featured internationally
              </p>


              <details class="achievement-details mt-5">

                <summary>Read More</summary>

                <div
                  class="
                    mt-5
                    text-xs
                    leading-6
                    text-neutral-700
                  "
                  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
                >

                  This work is a recreation of the
                  <strong>
                    Kurazukuri Townscape of Koedo Kawagoe Ichibangai Shopping Street
                  </strong>
                  in Saiwaicho, Kawagoe City, Saitama Prefecture,
                  faithfully based on the real location.

                  <br /><br />

                  I recreated the historic streetscape and architectural styles
                  that have continued since the Meiji period,
                  including details such as roofs, latticework,
                  roof tiles, and stone paving.

                  The work was featured in numerous media outlets in Japan
                  and abroad, including the Japanese news website
                  "Nlab."

                </div>

              </details>


              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <a
                  href="https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/cont/articles/3398021/"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  News Article
                </a>


                <a
                  href="https://x.com/nishikinolab/status/1904832266984976533"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  X Post
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </article>



          <article
            class="
              overflow-hidden
              rounded-[1.25rem]
              border
              border-white/60
              bg-white/90
              backdrop-blur-sm
              transition
              duration-500
              hover:-translate-y-1
              hover:shadow-xl
              sm:rounded-[1.5rem]
            "
          >

            <div class="achievement-media">

              <iframe
                class="aspect-video w-full"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vALpinxBdxM"
                title="Edo Castle Restoration Project"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>

            </div>


            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">

              <p
                class="
                  text-[10px]
                  tracking-[0.3em]
                  text-neutral-500
                "
                style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
              >
                2025 / 06 / 24
              </p>


              <h2
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xl
                  leading-tight
                  text-neutral-900
                "
                style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
              >
                Edo Castle<br />
                Restoration Project
              </h2>


              <p
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xs
                  text-neutral-500
                "
              >
                My second major media feature in Japan and abroad
              </p>


              <details class="achievement-details mt-5">

                <summary>Read More</summary>

                <div
                  class="
                    mt-5
                    text-xs
                    leading-6
                    text-neutral-700
                  "
                  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
                >

                  This is a long-term project to digitally reconstruct
                  <strong>Edo Castle</strong>,
                  which once covered a vast area in Chiyoda,
                  Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo,

                  based on historical documents,
                  old maps, old photographs,
                  archaeological findings, and written records.

                  <br /><br />

                  The scope of the project extends far beyond
                  the present-day Imperial Palace East Gardens.
                  It covers the vast historical Edo Castle area,
                  including the Honmaru, Ninomaru, Sannomaru,
                  Nishinomaru, Fukiage Gardens,
                  the outer fortifications, and the surrounding castle town.

                  <br /><br />

                  A YouTube video showing the work in progress
                  was featured in numerous media outlets in Japan
                  and abroad, including the Japanese news website
                  "Nlab."

                </div>

              </details>


              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <a
                  href="https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/cont/articles/3431502/"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  News Article
                </a>


                <a
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vALpinxBdxM"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  YouTube
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </article>


          <article
            class="
              overflow-hidden
              rounded-[1.25rem]
              border
              border-white/60
              bg-white/90
              backdrop-blur-sm
              transition
              duration-500
              hover:-translate-y-1
              hover:shadow-xl
              sm:rounded-[1.5rem]
            "
          >

            <div class="achievement-media">

              <iframe
                class="aspect-video w-full"
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/cJjq_H8yJ_8"
                title="AMATERAS SMP Infinity Castle"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>

            </div>


            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">

              <p
                class="
                  text-[10px]
                  tracking-[0.3em]
                  text-neutral-500
                "
                style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
              >
                2026 / 03 / 31
              </p>


              <h2
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xl
                  leading-tight
                  text-neutral-900
                "
                style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
              >
                AMATERAS SMP<br />
                Large-Scale Build Project: Infinity Castle
              </h2>


              <p
                class="
                  mt-2
                  text-xs
                  text-neutral-500
                "
              >
                First contribution to a large-scale project
              </p>


              <details class="achievement-details mt-5">

                <summary>Read More</summary>

                <div
                  class="
                    mt-5
                    text-xs
                    leading-6
                    text-neutral-700
                  "
                  style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
                >

                  I participated in the large-scale survival building project
                  featured on the official channel of the Minecraft server
                  <strong>AMATERAS SMP</strong>,

                  where I was involved in the architectural design
                  and construction of the
                  <strong>Infinity Castle</strong>,
                  featured in the popular series
                  "Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba."

                  <br /><br />

                  The Infinity Castle in
                  "Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba"
                  is a major setting known for its unique structure,
                  where spaces continuously extend in every direction.

                  <br /><br />

                  After completing the castle while recreating
                  the scale and impact of the original work,
                  the finished Infinity Castle was released
                  as one of the videos in AMATERAS SMP's
                  official YouTube series featuring the
                  large-scale survival building project.

                  <br /><br />

                </div>

              </details>


              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <a
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cJjq_H8yJ_8"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  Video
                </a>


                <a
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/@AMATERAS_SMP"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="
                    rounded-full
                    border
                    border-neutral-300
                    px-4
                    py-2
                    text-xs
                    text-neutral-800
                    transition
                    hover:bg-neutral-900
                    hover:text-white
                  "
                >
                  AMATERAS SMP Official Channel
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </article>


        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section
      class="
        relative
        mx-auto
        max-w-7xl
        px-5
        py-14
        sm:px-8
        sm:py-16
        lg:px-10
        lg:py-20
      "
    >

      <div
        class="
          rounded-[1.5rem]
          border
          border-white/60
          bg-white/85
          p-7
          text-center
          backdrop-blur-sm
          sm:rounded-[2rem]
          sm:p-10
        "
      >

        <p
          class="
            text-[10px]
            tracking-[0.3em]
            text-neutral-500
          "
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          NEXT CHAPTER
        </p>


        <h2
          class="
            mt-3
            text-2xl
            text-neutral-900
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          I will keep moving forward.
        </h2>


        <p
          class="
            mx-auto
            mt-5
            max-w-3xl
            text-sm
            leading-7
            text-neutral-700
          "
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          Centered on the reconstruction of castles,
          historic architecture, and traditional townscapes,
          I will continue creating new works
          and sharing them with the world.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>

  </div>

</section>


<script
  async
  src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js"
  charset="utf-8"
></script>


